  "title": "Rotator Cuff Repair (Open or Arthroscopic)",
  "jurisdiction": "Medicare Administrative Contractor (MAC) LCD",
  "effective_date": "2023-01-01",
  "category": "Orthopedic Surgery",
  "description": "Medicare coverage guidelines for rotator cuff repair. Requires MRI confirming full-thickness tendon tear (or high-grade partial tear > 50%), persistent pain/weakness, and failure of at least 3 months of conservative care (or acute traumatic tear in active patient).",
