      "name": "Full-Thickness or High-Grade Rotator Cuff Tear on MRI",
      "description": "Diagnostic MRI or ultrasound confirming full-thickness supraspinatus/infraspinatus tear or high-grade partial thickness tear > 50% depth.",
      "clinical_intent": "Structural confirmation of tendon discontinuity",
      "criterion_type": "FINDING_PRESENCE",
